  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate football experience with this custom sports-themed comforter set by Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and coaches, this bedding set brings the spirit of the game directly to your bedroom. Featuring a striking, vibrant digital illustration design, it serves as both a cozy layer of breathable warmth and a stylish piece of sports home decor.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customization options allow you to personalize your bedding with up to 2 text inputs, including a Name and Number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy &amp; Soft Comfort:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose the perfect fit for your bed with options including Twin (68\" x 88\" or 68\"x90\"), Full (78\" x 88\" or 79\"x90\"), Queen (88\" x 88\" or 90\"x90\"), and King (104\" x 88\" or 104\"x90\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Included Components:</strong> Each package includes 1 Duvet Cover or Comforter, with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheet covers based on your selection.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water. Tumble dry on low heat or air dry without heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Durability:</strong> Features environmental protection printing techniques to prevent fading, along with smooth, fine, and compact edge stitching.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester with Microfiber Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Football &amp; Helmet on Fire</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football &amp; Helmet on Fire</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Do not bleach, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
